WakaTime API key, emitted as `secret-tool` arguments.

Two consumers must name the SAME entry or the key silently resolves empty:

  dot_wakatime.cfg.tmpl                      api_key_vault_cmd, which
                                             wakatime-cli and every editor
                                             plugin resolve through
  .chezmoiscripts/30-linux/run_onchange_after_config-wakatime-keyring.sh.tmpl
                                             seeds the entry from 1Password

A mismatch produces "api key not found or empty" with nothing pointing at the
attribute set, so it lives here rather than being retyped at each site.

Usage:  secret-tool lookup {{ includeTemplate "wakatime-keyring.tmpl" . }}
*/ -}}
